WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.888
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.888 --> 00:00:21.776
Start a new child within this family. Use Add beside the child selector. Keep the existing household rather than creating another family.

00:00:21.776 --> 00:00:32.664
Enter the child identity. Enter the child’s actual legal name, preferred name and date of birth. These example values are synthetic.

00:00:32.664 --> 00:00:43.852
Set the planned enrollment state. Choose the verified status. Pending is appropriate only when supported by the enrollment record; do not activate care merely to bill a fee.

00:00:43.852 --> 00:00:56.329
Review before saving. Review the family and new child before Add child. After an authorized save, reopen the household and verify both children. Tuition is a separate step.

